description.narrative:
The overall objective of the contribution is to strengthen democratic and inclusive security sector governance in Serbia.

This objective will be addressed through four sets of activities/result areas:

Result 1: Implementation of personal data protection legislation is strengthened, with particular focus on the security sector;

Result 2: Capacities for inclusive and effective implementation of security and emergency-management plans are enhanced;

Result 3: Participation of civil society in governance of the security sector is increased;

Result 4: Education and expertise in the security sector is further enhanced.
